            "1 Ai ntwn ni, ata lwmgaymei geic e;",
            "Ai nthan ni, kadan bammei nunc khang;",
            "Ai taanc bam ni, ryanra khaengv khang nai geic e;",
            "Ai bauc rap ni, zaucgay bam khang geic e,",
            "Ai bauc rap ni, zaucgay bam khang geic e.",
            "",
            "2 Ai kapam-karai maekmei nunc pam sw ni,",
            "Ai ^&8 tiipatmei kaipat chak lak ge;",
            "Ai niamh bam ni, aramsuan nai geih zaeng ^&8,",
            "Pou ta zaucna zianna neihlaa bam ni,",
            "Pou ta zaucna zianna neihlaa bam ni.",
            "",
            "3 Ai taanv tyn khou Kakhou huayney geic bam ni,",
            "Ai Ravguangc lev tamzuan tanh tan bam ni,",
            "Kakhwan chu khang alwnlung’twnna lungc ni,",
            "Lwmpui paan ^&8 Khrista phaykaamv suic ni,",
